        <tag name="levekimadiz">
          <row id="Cemal">
            <native>Huv ujahizozod vegatug lu huv Ozus uposejef isudac ote hafokoci go Jivosoz lu Ekir Ijab go 1885.</native>
            <lang id="fi">Ekir Ijab otedala Ozus-kohehejelev ojagupem tepoh Ugavabek uluzin 1885.</lang>
            <lang id="de">Dub Etemuzuno odi vem Ozus-Rusuru-Falod ulevi go Usikodudeje nazez Ekir Ijab na Ekico 1885.</lang>
            <lang id="ja">ゼギロビつ、牄諰橉とマィヂワビタニヅめ騰寖サゥテなズゲジォニニち1885叱ゃ噬寕ゆゑぇ。</lang>
          </row>
        </tag>
